1
00:00:00,489 --> 00:00:04,000
易考范文二十二

2
00:00:04,009 --> 00:00:09,000
What we can see in the picture is a young woman,

3
00:00:09,009 --> 00:00:11,400
who stands for the online dealers,

4
00:00:11,409 --> 00:00:14,340
is blowing a balloon with the word

5
00:00:14,349 --> 00:00:18,650
“commitment” on it. While a consumer shrinks

6
00:00:18,659 --> 00:00:20,610
at the sight of this giant balloon,

7
00:00:20,619 --> 00:00:22,300
fearing that it might burst.

8
00:00:22,309 --> 00:00:25,880
Obviously, this picture aims to criticize

9
00:00:25,889 --> 00:00:29,230
those dishonest online businesses

10
00:00:29,239 --> 00:00:33,190
which induce people to buy with empty promises.

11
00:00:33,199 --> 00:00:37,120
Shopping on the Internet has become an ingredient

12
00:00:37,129 --> 00:00:40,300
of our life thanks to the prevalence of the cyberspace.

13
00:00:40,309 --> 00:00:44,190
The superiority of online shopping is evident.

14
00:00:44,199 --> 00:00:47,090
People can compare prices without bothering

15
00:00:47,099 --> 00:00:49,440
to walking from one shop to another

16
00:00:49,449 --> 00:00:53,080
and make decisions independent of salespeople's

17
00:00:53,089 --> 00:00:56,710
endless persuasion. They can just settle themselves

18
00:00:56,719 --> 00:00:59,050
in a comfortable chair, have a cup of tea,

19
00:00:59,059 --> 00:01:02,430
click the mouse, and then everything is arranged.

20
00:01:02,439 --> 00:01:06,170
Nevertheless, sometimes shoppers find the products

21
00:01:06,179 --> 00:01:07,920
they receive are different from

22
00:01:07,929 --> 00:01:09,580
those shown on the computer screen;

23
00:01:09,589 --> 00:01:12,680
what's more, if goods they buy from

24
00:01:12,689 --> 00:01:14,190
the Internet are defective,

25
00:01:14,199 --> 00:01:16,740
it will be hard to demand a refund.

26
00:01:16,749 --> 00:01:21,180
As this issue has drawn attention in a wide range,

27
00:01:21,189 --> 00:01:24,770
every effort is made to improve online shopping.

28
00:01:24,779 --> 00:01:27,660
It is good to know that most shops

29
00:01:27,669 --> 00:01:29,830
in the cyberspace are evaluated

30
00:01:29,839 --> 00:01:32,130
by a customer appraisal system,

31
00:01:32,139 --> 00:01:34,290
because of which honesty has become

32
00:01:34,299 --> 00:01:36,490
a matter of self-interest for them.

33
00:01:36,499 --> 00:01:40,390
In addition, it is suggested that online shoppers

34
00:01:40,399 --> 00:01:42,390
be well-informed and cautious before making buying decisions.

